            <div xml:id="m-ecf866c5-fa94-4f5f-8cbb-19e8d0d59a8a">
              <lg xml:id="m-57d8a0c7-10f0-4669-9e04-58b9602fb7b3">
                <l xml:id="m-806e7e99-bee0-4ebf-8240-3112329b9689" facs="#m-bfb189a7-5200-4a51-b60f-112df47a74ee" label="ambiguous">Deus canticum. 7. b, d.</l><l xml:id="m-4c8d2935-218e-4707-947a-94bdebc9c3ec" facs="#m-f1a6cc53-2b0e-4ea8-9b96-68090287b4a8" label="ambiguous">193</l><l xml:id="m-f9381bd8-ce7e-4c54-9206-b9f49e3e5915" facs="#m-44af429f-a8be-4d7d-b9d5-de6f4e51f0b3" label="lyrics-like">2. Qui das salútem pégibus:“ qui redemísti Dávid sérvum túum de</l><l xml:id="m-050fdce5-10e5-4cf4-a0be-49954663f00a" facs="#m-1c0b117d-c605-4def-8892-403af07d52d2" label="lyrics-like">gládio malígno: éripe me.</l><l xml:id="m-ec1f373c-6461-4e38-9edb-ef04e568b48c" facs="#m-014f8fa6-414a-4a1b-8171-5a52dd8ea014" label="lyrics-like">3. Et érue me de mánu filiórum alienórum, t quórum os locútum est</l><l xml:id="m-e55ffba6-ad14-4130-9245-144b7e6270b7" facs="#m-d62573b7-4dda-424d-b555-c92f59067ab4" label="lyrics-like">vanttátem:“et déxtera eórum, déxtera iniquitátis:</l><l xml:id="m-5317bb5d-c137-4144-a19e-74e931d50eb5" facs="#m-4277dfc7-1b24-4b9a-a9e6-172bae88d470" label="lyrics-like">4. Quórum filii sicut novéllae plantattónes “in juventúte súa.</l><l xml:id="m-ae7c72eb-0e00-4192-a182-b85b7882ce25" facs="#m-8d928fdb-1aff-4484-92d5-9baa2988bd12" label="lyrics-like">5. Filiae eórum compósitae:“circumornátae ut similitúdo témpli.</l><l xml:id="m-42bc7267-a61b-4bbd-ab1d-bb130e6127a3" facs="#m-6aec6588-1788-4ca6-94c5-046b21bca66f" label="lyrics-like">6. Promptuária eórum pléna, *eructántia ex hoc in illud¬</l><l xml:id="m-f373a254-45f5-481e-ac7b-245e39c22933" facs="#m-7f09680d-d913-4f8c-b544-69a8f30bcf26" label="lyrics-like">7. Oves eórum foetósae, abundántes in egréssibus súis: * bóves</l><l xml:id="m-3980ab1b-01a5-4723-af20-68c52d52d487" facs="#m-d2d4af21-f459-44e0-94fe-75734aa15df2" label="lyrics-like">eórum erássae.</l><l xml:id="m-3a3d3298-5e6d-4c6a-8f72-6a92bced6e6b" facs="#m-ce1f3412-81a7-42da-a17f-cadec346e605" label="lyrics-like">8. Non est ruína macériae, neque tránsitus: * neque clámor in</l><l xml:id="m-ab529327-49e4-4a26-8708-2bcdd7554a33" facs="#m-c4d8027c-cddc-4adb-a9bb-84098baa8720" label="lyrics-like">platéis eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-a4b73096-7ff6-4ddd-a50f-e0adf1a83048" facs="#m-6fa586a9-29da-449b-a48c-33a321af8dfd" label="lyrics-like">9. Beátum dixérunt pópulum cúi haée sunt:beátus pópulus cújus</l><l xml:id="m-8dc7ac42-fbd1-41d5-ba07-bfbf77d5c961" facs="#m-4e4075c3-84cc-4cd9-92ed-903f685f475f" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus Déus éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-32634a7b-81b5-490a-93e5-c46fb5a1dd5f" facs="#m-3b012ad6-718c-42fa-b616-fadf764ea214" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-2d515b76-018a-4179-a2fa-b19576d2dc28" facs="#m-3bc18658-74e0-4ea0-9408-471cecbdce29" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5b2ad36-763a-47ce-bf68-a65e56b16e59" facs="#m-fbe38104-9c04-49a1-93b5-546dc58cb957" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1f00b6d0-7c32-4b09-8843-86b7a4e9017c" facs="#m-2bdc4283-f38f-4645-aa35-9650b1513b41" label="ambiguous">Tone 7. b, d.</l><l xml:id="m-305fa02e-b95a-4274-8bac-54c1430dc790" facs="#m-31310961-4bd6-4b21-b490-d18dab38241e" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-010330a0-2741-4c8a-80ce-328eac58ab2a" facs="#m-433f95d2-3fc5-48ac-bf8d-00dd74ead8ca" label="text-like">Endings of a accents.</l><l xml:id="m-9703a117-bd34-4590-853b-dcad00e19be6" facs="#m-40b4d193-14c8-4466-8636-0a94af09b366" label="lyrics-like">1. Dé-us cánticum nóvum cantá-bo ti- bi:* in psalté-ri-o, decachór¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5a58307-c569-4d9b-b250-2959d24d034e" facs="#m-d4c73cfd-e5b5-469b-a1fd-578ccc2ccbc7" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-570201cd-7eda-4fef-9416-7856059710f2" facs="#m-846e90b7-84d0-475e-a5e1-3bc2650bd8bf" label="ambiguous">b</l><l xml:id="m-a61185ee-a867-4f12-9b8d-5702c4af66ea" facs="#m-310df030-2f8c-415e-ba3e-f7b752042f79" label