><l xml:id="m-6e10ad5e-01a2-4cd5-91fe-d58f062bd1ff" facs="#m-1bb0c5e3-91ae-4f62-8dcd-fed9b368e673" label="lyrics-like">9. Beátum dixérunt pópulum eui haée sunt:* beátus pópulus cújus</l><l xml:id="m-e0a6a6f4-5f40-4e13-b0cb-61a933dd4bfb" facs="#m-2e34cce5-2da8-42c6-8ad0-453fb81c7c0b" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus Déus éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-efad18f5-7ad3-425c-8ad1-ee5aa0dc6483" facs="#m-99be7835-7edc-43c9-9a7c-f134281c51f1" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-32df3030-2ff3-4db7-b60c-927c533ff778" facs="#m-7fef9daa-57ab-41bc-87a2-b224ec9c2b38" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et nûne, et sémper, “et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-90895e60-3811-4fea-a07d-f738db2661da" facs="#m-425139bf-646e-419d-adbe-6b716492a0da" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l></lg>
